{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"About Losaka: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja41'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 41 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Atthakāmavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Wanting to Help </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>1. Losakajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>About Losaka: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Yo atthakāmassa hitānukampino, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>One who does not follow advice when instructed </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ovajjamāno na karoti sāsanaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>by an ally who desires their good, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ajiyā pādamolamba, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>grieves like Mittaka </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Mittako viya socatī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>hanging off a goat’s foot. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Losakajātakaṁ paṭhamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
